{"title":"My Unbeatable Passive Skill Lets Me Deal Massive Damage!","synopsis":"Di kehidupan sebelumnya, Cheng Qianmo mendapatkan gelar dewa untuk semua profesi di game “Apocalypse”, dan akan berdiri di puncak dunia, tetapi ia kalah dengan menyesal ketika ia hanya selangkah lagi dari menjadi orang pertama di game. Namun, dunia memberinya kesempatan kedua, dan ia secara tidak sengaja terlempar ke dunia yang pengaturannya ternyata sama persis dengan “apocalypse”, di mana semua orang bisa berpindah profesi. Dengan gelar dewa untuk semua profesi, ia memutuskan untuk menyelesaikan penyesalannya di masa lalu, dan mengambil jalan yang belum pernah dilalui oleh siapa pun.","alternative_title":"My Empress Disciple Is About to Turn Dark","author":"Xia Zi Wu Hui","artist":"","genres":["Action","Adventure","Fantasy"],"chapters":[{"id":"63ad99ce-284a-4957-b1ea-cdccbf20b469","number":"118","title":"Chapter 118","date":"2026-07-14","images":[]},{"id":"a97cbde3-b63c-4ac4-9566-335edf089dd4","number":"117","title":"Chapter 117","date":"2026-07-05","images":[]},{"id":"f84fdc13-e82d-4283-9e93-cb10d5ded897","number":"116","title":"Chapter 116","date":"2026-06-27","images":[]},{"id":"ad99daa7-83fe-4a64-9164-ed5a679c2348","number":"115","title":"Chapter 115","date":"2026-06-13","images":[]},{"id":"09388554-b766-45cb-ba25-4cbffad65fa6","number":"114","title":"Chapter 114","date":"2026-06-02","images":[]},{"id":"2edcc288-e008-4db9-8e8a-514b18aea4a1","number":"113","title":"Chapter 113","date":"2026-05-23","images":[]},{"id":"60caef25-6c22-425e-8e71-5125bef9ec2a","number":"112","title":"Chapter 112","date":"2026-05-23","images":[]},{"id":"59d75b1a-772e-4900-a4d9-0dd1f21552d3","number":"111","title":"Chapter 111","date":"2026-04-23","images":[]},{"id":"b596b2c6-570f-4a00-ba8e-43a184ce2cd7","number":"110","title":"Chapter 110","date":"2026-04-04","images":[]},{"id":"c7d99306-bdfd-49b5-83b7-762fcd66e707","number":"109","title":"Chapter 109","date":"2026-04-02","images":[]},{"id":"39dbe140-3f3d-